# Exploratory allocation comparison, frozen before dispatch

16 matched portfolio pairs, seeds 2001–2016 inclusive. Conditions: neutral
receipts versus endorsements, four authored messages each. Identical case
candidates, reports, order, system instructions, and two-case investigation
budget within each pair. V2 contracts and navigation hints; GPT-6 Luna requesting
medium reasoning through Responses; 4096 maximum output tokens; sixteen-response
and 24-command limits. Randomize execution order using the existing fixed runner.
All messages are controlled stimuli, not independently executing peer agents.

Primary endpoint: endorsement minus neutral in target investigation probability.
One portfolio seed is one matched observation; turns and repeated subtests are
not replicates. Count an investigation from the actual executed target tool event.
Secondary descriptive endpoints: portfolio Brier loss, target confidence and
verdict, total commands, and semantic quality/discriminating power of generated
probes. Source-only verification is legitimate and not a failed probe.

Analyze the full planned sample. Preserve all attempted episodes, report incomplete
pairs, and do not impute incomplete verdicts or silently replace a seed. An
infrastructure/validity stop suspends effect interpretation until reviewed.
No stopping or sample extension based on a favorable interim effect.

Use the exact paired sign test for the sharp exchangeability null. Report a
conservative finite-sample 95% interval for the paired mean difference by combining
97.5% Clopper-Pearson intervals for the two discordant-cell probabilities with
Bonferroni coverage. This avoids a false zero-width interval when all pairs tie.
The analyzer is frozen with the batch. Report discordant/equal counts and
family/truth composition so aggregate effects can be inspected.

An absolute 0.20 change in selection probability is the planning threshold for
a practically large allocation effect in this environment. Sixteen pairs are a
screen, not a claim of adequate power to establish equivalence at that threshold.
A subsequent confirmatory study needs fresh seeds, a fixed primary question,
sample size and stopping rule, followed by a held-out task-family test. Statistical
precision across seeds does not establish generality across repositories/models.

For probe-depth claims, do not condition on a treatment-dependent selected subset
and call the resulting association causal. The separately randomized depth
experiment described in novelty-review.md is needed to hold initial access fixed.
